RootEdu Alembic migrations.

Run from the backend directory after installing requirements and configuring DATABASE_URL:

    alembic upgrade head

The initial migration creates tenant and academic-scope foundations, plus distinct audit and security event tables. Tenant-scoped tables use PostgreSQL row-level security. Runtime queries must set the transaction-local `app.tenant_id` only after authentication, using a trusted institution ID from server-side identity. Never trust a client-supplied tenant identifier.
